  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MisanthropyDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/Linggango/Linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"32\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CKjFgGdY/backgorund.png\" alt=\"背景橫幅\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.6\"><span style=\"color:#fb766a\"> <strong>&raquo; 設定：</strong>在 CurseForge 設定中使用 <strong>\"Mojang Launcher\"</strong> 選項。<br><strong>&raquo; Linux 使用者：</strong>為求穩定，請停用 <strong><a style=\"color:#fb766a;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spark</a></strong> 與 <strong><a style=\"color:#fb766a;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iris-flywheel-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Oculus Flywheel Compat</a></strong> 模組。<br><strong>&raquo; 記憶體：</strong>至少配置 <strong>6 GB</strong>（建議 8 GB）。 </span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.5\">Linggango 是一個高度客製化的模組包，帶有微妙的《泰拉瑞亞》靈感。<br>內含大量自訂內容與獨特機制，目前處於 Beta 測試階段，持續進行更新與優化。<br><br>加入 Discord 以獲取伺服器整合包與定期開發更新。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"32\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJwFS0g/523.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 全面重構的進度系統 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">進度嚴格受限。關鍵武器、工具與里程碑皆需擊敗 Boss 後解鎖。<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5XWQVx5X/proghint2.png\" alt=\"進度提示\" width=\"100%\"></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>- 獨特遊玩風格 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">選擇你的道路。從兩種起始戒指中挑選其一，將大幅改變遊戲玩法機制。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWX8p6xJ/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043452.png\" alt=\"戒指選擇\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">七咒之戒</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWCjhWQ4/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043637.png\" alt=\"七咒之戒\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">七德之戒</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GvpyhWkp/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043650.png\" alt=\"七德之戒\" width=\"100%\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-style:italic\">兩枚戒指皆具備獨特的優缺點，將影響你的角色構築。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 超過 60 個 Boss -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">面對數量龐大的自訂 Boss 陣容。充分的準備至關重要。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6RZpm1nX/2026-01-12-05-57-51.png\" alt=\"Boss 戰 1\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSVsdQxk/2026-01-12-06-05-42.png\" alt=\"Boss 戰 2\" width=\"100%\"> <strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SXSKT21y/2026-01-12-06-02-47.png\" alt=\"Boss 戰 3\" width=\"100%\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 任務系統 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">詳盡的自訂任務書將引導你度過各個進度階段，並熟悉各模組機制。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fYk66Fwx/javaw-8a-T3s7ka9q.gif\" alt=\"任務書示範\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 精美的世界生成 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">採用完全自訂的地形生成技術，專為 Forge 環境量身打造。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2ph4cMh/2026-06-26-16-03-43.png\" alt=\"地形 1\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXWgRWXL/2026-06-05-04-31-49.png\" alt=\"地形 2\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4ZJxkvxX/2026-06-26-16-10-22.png\" alt=\"地形 3\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rf66Wphc/2026-06-26-16-07-08.png\" alt=\"地形 4\" width=\"100%\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/S4nBRDmN/2026-06-26-16-14-37.png\" alt=\"地形 5\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdYPLKBt/2026-07-03-04-55-46.png\" alt=\"地形 6\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 效能優化 -</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:normal\">優化是核心重點。本模組包並非僅添加通用的效能模組，而是經過手動調校以確保穩定性。在 Beta 測試期間，效能將持續提升。</h3>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#fbeeb8;font-size:1.2em\">基準測試 1</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬體：</strong>Ryzen 5 5600 | RX 5700 XT | 16GB RAM (3200MHz)<br><strong>設定：</strong>12 Chunks | V-Sync Off | Complementary Shaders<br><strong>版本：</strong>v4.5~<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">結果：120+ FPS，幀時間穩定</span></p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:1.2em\">基準測試 2</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬體：</strong>Ryzen 7 7800X3D | RX 7900 XT | 32GB RAM (5600MHz)<br><strong>設定：</strong>32 Chunks | V-Sync Off | Complementary Shaders<br><strong>版本：</strong>v6.5<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">結果：110–130 FPS，幀時間穩定</span></p>\n</div>\n<hr style=\"border:0\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:monospace\">\n<p><strong style=\"color:#fbeeb8;font-size:1.2em\">基準測試 3</strong></p>\n<p><strong>硬體：</strong>Ryzen 5 5600X | RX 7800 XT | 32GB RAM (3600MHz)<br><strong>設定：</strong>12 Chunks | V-Sync Off | Shaders Off<br><strong>版本：</strong>v6.4~<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#a3e635\">結果：500–600 FPS，無重大幀時間下降</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想與朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用 Kinetic Hosting 以合理價格託管高效能伺服器。<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252fmodpacks%252flingango%252forder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9mR5GxD4/z-Ikb-PZc.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting 廣告橫幅\"></a></p>",
